            "relation": "USES_PHYSICAL_SCHEME",
            "target_entity_instance": "Atkinson et al. 2006 growth equation",
            "target_entity_type": "PhysicalScheme",
            "paragraph": "The simulations presented here are based on descriptions of krill daily growth rates by Atkinson et al., 2006. The authors measured the inter-molt intervals and the growth rates from a variety of krill samples from several parts of the Antarctic Ocean. The basic equation describes krill growth per day (in mm) as a function of the current length of the krill animal (Lkrill), temperature and available food (phytoplankton, expressed as mg Chlorophyl A per cubic meter):",
