            "paragraph": "We simulated the effect of sea ice as an addition of Chlorophyll A/krill food, sinusoidally varying annually with a peak in October. We also simulated climate change impacts by gradually reducing the sea ice by 50% over ten years.",
            "ontology_conformed": false,
